     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hola Diego, <div>Estoy haciendo un zoom por estado y quiero ponerle a cada municipio su label. </div><div>Estaba intentando usar esto que viene en tu página: </div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;overflow:auto\">p <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">+</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/ggrepel/topics/geom_text_repel\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(55,95,132)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/ggrepel/topics/geom_text_repel&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246139302000&amp;usg=AOvVaw30BQt6ydEgfcm3Aa-NPd0M\">geom_text_repel</a></span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">data =</span> df_mxstate, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(55,95,132)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246139302000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Begrfe9E_qitV0mH6e5d1\">aes</a></span>(lon, lat, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">label =</span> state_abbr), <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">size =</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">3</span>,\r\n                  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">box.padding =</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/reexports.html\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(55,95,132)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/reexports.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246139302000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SMGK0lR62j1zAoAX9p9Xw\">unit</a></span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(21,20,181)\">0.1</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;lines&#39;</span>), <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">force =</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(21,20,181)\">0.1</span>)</code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-radius:4px\">pero no tengo éxito. Para ponerlas labels también debo usar longitud y latitud?</pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-radius:4px\">Saludos, </pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-radius:4px\">Abigail</pre></div></div>"
